      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "2. Add the egg, starch, and ginger root juice and process briefly."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "3. Put the onion and carrot in a bowl and mix in the flour."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "4. Mix the fish mixture with the vegetable mixture."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "5. Divide into 6 and deep fry for 4 minutes."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "6. Serve with the ginger and soy sauce."
    }
